1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
San Matthew Kapitulo 4

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:09,240
Tisperto in turungna ni Jesus ijelet ang tatnusulisogan ti Diablo,

3
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:15,400
kalpasan tiupat apulong aldaw kinrabi asaan na apanangan na bisinan ni Jesus.

4
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,560
Imasidig kinkwana ti Diablo kit kinunana.

5
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:22,300
Nusika ti anak ti Diyos,

6
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:26,640
pagbalingem at tinapay dagitoy abato.

7
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:30,000
Nga'ng insungbat ni Jesus,

8
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,420
kuna tinasantuan na surat,

9
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:35,860
saan lang at tinapay tipagbyag ti tao,

10
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:40,340
nudi paiket titunggal balikas ng agkapo iti Diyos.

11
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:44,580
Ti Diablo in turungna ni Jesus itinasantuan na syudad

12
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:48,000
kit impan na itikangatuan na paset ti templo.

13
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,400
Sana kinuna.

14
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,360
Nusika ti anak ti Diyos,

15
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:55,440
tumapuak ka man,

16
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:56,580
agsigna,

17
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:59,820
siputakuna tinasantuan na surat,

18
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:06,100
bilinen to ti Diyos dagit iang heles na amang aywan kenka,

19
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:11,500
tapayain na kanto tap nuuray dagit isakam,

20
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:15,200
saan amadunor itibato.

21
00:01:16,620 --> 00:01:18,640
Nga'ng insungbat ni Jesus,

22
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,480
kunamet tinasantuan na surat,

23
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:25,400
di mo sulisugan ti apo a Diyos mo.

24
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:25,480
Nga'ng insungbat ni Jesus,

25
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:25,500
kunamet tinasantuan na surat,

26
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:25,520
di mo sulisugan ti apo a Diyos mo.

27
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:29,380
Impan ti Diyablo itinakangat nga to abantay

28
00:01:29,380 --> 00:01:35,640
kit impakita na kinkwana dagiti amin apagarian ditoy lubong agraman dayagda.

29
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:40,520
Itdektukin ka amin dagito'y.

30
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,580
Kinuna ti Diyablo,

31
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:47,380
nuwag pa rin tuming kinagdayaw ka kanya.

32
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:50,040
Insungbat ni Jesus,

33
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,660
Pumanaw ka, satanas,

34
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:55,200
kuna tinasantuan na surat,

35
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:58,380
agdaydayaw ka iti apo a Diyos mo,

36
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:00,520
ket isulaeng tipagsirbiyan.

37
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:02,680
Itikasta,

38
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,320
Pumanaw ti Diyablo.

39
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:06,400
Dimteng dakit ang hiles

40
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:08,080
ket nagsirbida kin ni Jesus.

41
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:10,240
Idi nadamag ni Jesus

42
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,460
anay balod ni Juan

43
00:02:11,460 --> 00:02:13,520
nagsubli iji Galilya,

44
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:16,100
saan anagtayang iji Nasaret,

45
00:02:16,660 --> 00:02:18,920
napankit din nagnayad iji Kapernaum,

46
00:02:19,500 --> 00:02:21,040
may sangaili itiigit

47
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,520
tidanaw tidi Galilya,

48
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:24,560
itisakop dagit idagat

49
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,220
iji Zabulon,

50
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:26,520
ken Neftali.

51
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:28,200
Na aramid daytoy

52
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:29,180
tatnumatong pal

53
00:02:29,180 --> 00:02:31,760
timpaddo ni Profeta Izayas.

54
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,780
Dagati Zabulon,

55
00:02:34,060 --> 00:02:35,240
ken dagati Neftali.

56
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:38,660
Itisibay tidanaw iti Balasio iti Hordan.

57
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:41,400
Galilya pagnaedan dagiti Hentil.

58
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,900
Dagiti tattaong agnaed

59
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:45,020
iti kasipngitan,

60
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:47,440
nakita dati naranyag alawag.

61
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,360
Ket kadagiti agnaed

62
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:51,380
iti nasipngit adaggan ipatay

63
00:02:51,380 --> 00:02:53,020
nagranyag tilawag.

64
00:02:53,780 --> 00:02:55,160
Manipod iti dayta at siyempo,

65
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,960
rinugyan ni Jesus

66
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:57,820
tinangasaba.

67
00:02:58,340 --> 00:02:59,560
Agbabawi kayo

68
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,820
kadagiti Basbasolio,

69
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:03,120
agsipod taasidagan

70
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,520
tipagaryan tilangit.

71
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,920
Idi magmagnan ni Jesus

72
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:09,160
itiigit tidanaw

73
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:09,980
ti Galilya,

74
00:03:10,660 --> 00:03:11,600
nakita na dagiti

75
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,160
agkabsat amang ngalap

76
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:14,300
ni Simon,

77
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,940
amanagan Pedro,

78
00:03:16,540 --> 00:03:17,360
kin ni Andres.

79
00:03:18,020 --> 00:03:19,180
Iwaywayat da idi

80
00:03:19,180 --> 00:03:21,160
itiikit da iji danaw.

81
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:22,780
Surutan dak,

82
00:03:22,780 --> 00:03:24,620
kat pagbalinan kayo

83
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:25,500
ito amang ngalap,

84
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,420
kadagiti tao.

85
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:28,960
Kinunan ni Jesus kadakwada.

86
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,160
Pinanawanda a dagos

87
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:32,060
dagiti ikit da,

88
00:03:32,220 --> 00:03:33,660
kit si Muro da kinkwana.

89
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:36,360
Intuloy ni Jesus tinagnakit

90
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:38,600
nakita natin sa balipay ng agkabsat,

91
00:03:39,340 --> 00:03:40,760
da Santiago kin Juan

92
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:42,380
na anak ni Sibidio.

93
00:03:43,140 --> 00:03:44,580
Silulugan da iti bangka

94
00:03:44,580 --> 00:03:46,000
agraman ni Sibidio,

95
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:48,760
kit isagsaganada dagiti ikit da.

96
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,600
Inayaban ni Jesus ida.

97
00:03:51,580 --> 00:03:52,860
Dagos a pinanawanda

98
00:03:52,860 --> 00:03:53,500
iti amada,

99
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:55,500
kin tibangka kit si Muro,

100
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,840
da kin ni Jesus.

101
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,100
Sinurusor ni Jesus

102
00:04:00,100 --> 00:04:01,200
ti amin apaset

103
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:01,960
ti Galilea.

104
00:04:02,580 --> 00:04:03,860
Nangisursuro ti unag

105
00:04:03,860 --> 00:04:05,040
dagiti sinaguga da,

106
00:04:05,580 --> 00:04:06,540
inkas kasabana

107
00:04:06,540 --> 00:04:07,720
tinaymbaga da mag

108
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:09,080
maipapan iti pagaryan,

109
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:10,860
nangagagas ka dagiti

110
00:04:10,860 --> 00:04:11,680
naduma-duma

111
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:12,420
asaksakit

112
00:04:12,420 --> 00:04:13,920
kin sagsagaban

113
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:14,840
dagiti tataw.

114
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:16,940
Nagdinamag ni Jesus

115
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:17,940
iti entero

116
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:18,920
adaga ti siriya.

117
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:20,840
Impan dagiti tataw

118
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:21,480
kin kuwana

119
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,380
dagiti adaan

120
00:04:22,380 --> 00:04:23,400
tinaduma-duma

121
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:24,300
asaksakit

122
00:04:24,300 --> 00:04:25,300
kin ananayay.

123
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:27,220
Dagiti linuganan

124
00:04:27,220 --> 00:04:28,200
dagiti demonyo,

125
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,900
dagiti akis-kisil,

126
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:32,020
kin dagiti paralitiko,

127
00:04:32,020 --> 00:04:33,700
pinayambag amin

128
00:04:33,700 --> 00:04:34,540
ida ni Jesus.

129
00:04:34,540 --> 00:04:36,420
Si Muro't kin kuwana

130
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:37,960
dagiti aduo at tataw

131
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,860
anagapo iji Galilea,

132
00:04:39,860 --> 00:04:41,260
di Kapulis,

133
00:04:41,260 --> 00:04:42,580
Hiruzalem,

134
00:04:42,580 --> 00:04:43,860
hudya,

135
00:04:43,860 --> 00:04:45,400
kin dagiti dagdaga

136
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,320
iti balasyo

137
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:47,020
ti Hurdan.

